      "openalex_id": "W1999618681",
      "doi": "10.1080/13563460903290920#.vuyxctzwz9a",
      "title": "Social Democracy, Embeddedness and Decommodification: On the Conceptual Innovations and Intellectual Affiliations of Karl Polanyi",
      "authors": [
        {
